    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FROM THE GROUND-UP</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/groundup1.gif?t=1651528197\" /></div><br>Construct your cafe from the ground up! From the very foundation to the furniture your customers will sit on, the customization to change style and theme of your store is endless!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COFFEE CREATION</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/9a7eaef379269b310726a98344efe934.poster.avif?t=1651528197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/9a7eaef379269b310726a98344efe934.webm?t=1651528197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Carefully craft your coffee items while analyzing the expenses and profits for each drink!<br><br>Manage what kind of employees you wish to hire in order for your store to come to life!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HIRE EMPLOYEES</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/c3ddee8eac1f5b8d074a07b5b4867f4a.poster.avif?t=1651528197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/c3ddee8eac1f5b8d074a07b5b4867f4a.webm?t=1651528197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Manage your employees for each role! Each employee has their own skills, experience, and personality that would ultimately affect your customers moods! Choose carefully and manage carefully!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WISHLIST TODAY!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/37aab5de30847d5feada6afacc46d892.avif?t=1651528197\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FROM THE GROUND-UP</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/groundup1.gif?t=1651528197\" /></div><br>Construct your cafe from the ground up! From the very foundation to the furniture your customers will sit on, the customization to change style and theme of your store is endless!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COFFEE CREATION</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/9a7eaef379269b310726a98344efe934.poster.avif?t=1651528197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/9a7eaef379269b310726a98344efe934.webm?t=1651528197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Carefully craft your coffee items while analyzing the expenses and profits for each drink!<br><br>Manage what kind of employees you wish to hire in order for your store to come to life!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HIRE EMPLOYEES</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/c3ddee8eac1f5b8d074a07b5b4867f4a.poster.avif?t=1651528197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/c3ddee8eac1f5b8d074a07b5b4867f4a.webm?t=1651528197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Manage your employees for each role! Each employee has their own skills, experience, and personality that would ultimately affect your customers moods! Choose carefully and manage carefully!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WISHLIST TODAY!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1793360/extras/37aab5de30847d5feada6afacc46d892.avif?t=1651528197\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Expresso Espresso is a coffee shop management game with a great focus on in-depth coffee creation and market simulation. Roast different coffee beans from across the world, create different drinks from a variety of syrups and styles, manage your team of baristas to create the best coffee drink!",
